            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RMXBG, Rough Black Iron Heart Shaped Front Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAcorn's RMXBG Heart Shaped Door Knocker features a bold yet romantic design. The black iron finish exudes rustic charm because the uneven surface of rough iron duplicates that found on the ironwork of many European castles and cathedrals by imitating the texture of naturally weathered of iron. It is hefty enough to withstand years of abuse from the elements. It has a lifetime warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the RMXBG Rough Iron Heart Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Mounted with Included Screws</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
